<title>USA: TENNIS-MEMPHIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEMPHIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tennessee 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$825,000 St Jude men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denote seeding)</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>3-Todd Martin (U.S.) beat Brett Steven (New Zealand) 6-4 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3)</p>
<p>8-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 6-3</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>13-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat 5-Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
